    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The borders of the empire have been invaded, and many places have fallen, and the speed is getting faster and faster...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is running out, warriors, move forward bravely, drive out the invading enemies and liberate our homeland. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customized appearance<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519700/extras/881e9714c4cf68233ac85fd027f456f5.poster.avif?t=1746756929\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519700/extras/881e9714c4cf68233ac85fd027f456f5.webm?t=1746756929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519700/extras/881e9714c4cf68233ac85fd027f456f5.mp4?t=1746756929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519700/extras/53fb4e020ad630f26531ca04c2af937d.poster.avif?t=1746756929\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519700/extras/53fb4e020ad630f26531ca04c2af937d.webm?t=1746756929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519700/extras/53fb4e020ad630f26531ca04c2af937d.mp4?t=1746756929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique attack model system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configure the weapons and gems you collected to the attack model to change the skills and make you more powerful</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configure different weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519700/extras/8da1434d7cfdf466957e1dea0a971ac2.poster.avif?t=1746756929\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519700/extras/8da1434d7cfdf466957e1dea0a971ac2.webm?t=1746756929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519700/extras/8da1434d7cfdf466957e1dea0a971ac2.mp4?t=1746756929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inlay gems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519700/extras/9af1ee0705ebfe832977bfa67fc4b6e6.poster.avif?t=1746756929\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519700/extras/9af1ee0705ebfe832977bfa67fc4b6e6.webm?t=1746756929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519700/extras/9af1ee0705ebfe832977bfa67fc4b6e6.mp4?t=1746756929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Freely choose the tower climbing map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519700/extras/3bb6e65f46237fe0b2f59e647730eced.poster.avif?t=1746756929\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519700/extras/3bb6e65f46237fe0b2f59e647730eced.webm?t=1746756929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3519700/extras/3bb6e65f46237fe0b2f59e647730eced.mp4?t=1746756929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated map, you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit merchants</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit blacksmiths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig for gems</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open treasure chests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the unknown</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the above are up to you to choose</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan your time reasonably, strengthen your character before the time is up, and finally challenge the BOSS level! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
